# Vendored skill packs — pinned to an upstream commit, pulled on demand by pull.sh.
# Format (tab-separated): <pack>\t<tarball-url pinned to commit>\t<subtree>
#   subtree "." extracts the whole repo into skills/vendor/<pack>/;
#   otherwise only that subdirectory of the repo becomes the pack root.
# Refresh: bump the commit in the URL (latest default-branch hash) and re-run `pull.sh --force <pack>`.
ethskills	https://github.com/austintgriffith/ethskills/archive/191dcc1ead0182aab16d4c742bee8b15f2d0d8d7.tar.gz	.
